{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54384","headline":"岁尽日二首（之二） · 司空图","name":"岁尽日二首（之二）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"桂花穷北陆，荆艳下东邻。\n残粧欲送晓，薄衣已迎春。\n举袖争流雪，分歌竞绕尘。\n不应将共醉，年去远催人。\n（见上海图书馆藏明抄本《古今岁时杂咏》卷四一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}